Let $F^\bullet E(5|10)$ be the conjectural filtration of the exceptional Lie superalgebra. Identify its $N$th level with the holomorphic field theory $\chi_{\mathrm{hol}}(\mathfrak{sl}(N))$ for every $N>1$.

